MODULE physlib.quantum.open_systems.lindblad_driven_leads.

// Orchestration graph for the Schwarz et al. LDDL formalization.
// Lean remains the sole proof authority. A proof token names a declaration;
// CI must confirm that declaration before its evidence state becomes checked.

